 permettant son essor 

01:53:37.440 --> 01:53:41.760 line:61%
 comme jamais. 

01:53:41.800 --> 01:53:44.480 line:63%
 Depuis 2018, 
 nous sommes passés de 1000 

01:53:44.520 --> 01:53:47.040 line:63%
 à 3500 centres de formation 
 pour apprentissage. 

01:53:47.080 --> 01:53:48.240 line:63%
