01:55:47.960 --> 01:55:48.960 line:61%
 et des formations dispensées. 

01:55:49.000 --> 01:55:50.360 line:63%
 D'autre part, il faudrait 
 mutualiser certaines dépenses 

01:55:50.400 --> 01:55:51.400 line:61%
 communes aux chambres consulaires. 

01:55:51.440 --> 01:55:55.440 line:61%
 - Yaël Braun-Pivet: Merci. 

01:55:55.480 --> 01:55:59.280 line:63%
 La parole est à madame 
 Stéphanie Kochert. 

01:55:59.320 --> 01:56:06.280 line:61%
 - Stéphanie Kochert: Merci. 

01:56:06.320 --> 01:56:07.880 line:63%
 Ma question s'adresse à madame 
