 les week-ends et jours fériés. 

01:57:55.840 --> 01:57:56.880 line:63%
 Les grilles salariales 
 restent inchangées. 

01:57:56.920 --> 01:58:00.040 line:63%
 Madame la ministre, 
 nous devons soutenir 

01:58:00.080 --> 01:58:02.880 line:63%
