 essentiels? 

01:58:14.160 --> 01:58:17.800 line:61%
 - Yaël Braun-Pivet: Merci. 

01:58:17.840 --> 01:58:20.200 line:63%
 La parole est à madame 
 Fadila Khattabi. 

01:58:20.240 --> 01:58:27.280 line:61%
 - Fadila Khattabi: Merci. 

01:58:27.320 --> 01:58:30.760 line:63%
 Madame la députée, 
 je vous remercie 

01:58:30.800 --> 01:58:32.240 line:63%
 pour cette question 
 cruciale qui porte 

01:58:32.280 --> 01:58:35.880 line:63%
